  "fill": "No other run can reach this square, and 3 steps from 13 leaves nothing higher, so it must be 10.",
  "hexagonRun": "Only 15, between 14 and 16, can reach the ringed square (its area, striped), so it must be 15.",
  "rectBetween": "14 must sit next to both 13 and 15, and the ringed square is the only empty one that does, so it must be 14.",
